---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Team — Robles Technologies Corp."
  description="Meet the team behind Robles Technologies Corp. — co-founders Kenneth Robles and Christian Panes, the officers who run the company, and specialists across GEO, automation, project management, and Smartsheet development."
  active="team"
>
  <!-- PAGE HERO -->
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-pat"></div>
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span>Team</div>
    <span class="sec-tag">The People Behind RTC</span>
    <h1 class="sec-h">World-class specialists.<br>Built for your outcomes.</h1>
    <p class="sec-p">Our team is made up of dedicated IT professionals who bring deep expertise, strong communication, and a results-first mindset to every engagement.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- LEADERSHIP -->
  <section class="sec" style="background:var(--white);">
    <div class="rv" style="margin-bottom:48px;">
      <span class="sec-tag">Leadership</span>
      <h2 class="sec-h">Who leads RTC</h2>
      <p class="sec-p">Robles Technologies Corp. was co-founded by Kenneth Robles and Christian Panes, with one shared mission: to bridge exceptional IT talent with businesses that demand real results.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- KENNETH -->
    <div class="leader-bio-grid rv">
      <div>
        <div class="about-visual-card">
          <p>Co-Founder with a corporate IT background spanning enterprise systems, Smartsheet development, and technical consulting. Kenneth leads client delivery and business operations, ensuring every engagement is grounded in real business outcomes.</p>
          <div class="about-stat-row" style="margin-top:28px;">
            <div class="about-stat-box"><div class="about-stat-num"><span>10+</span></div><div class="about-stat-lbl">Projects</div></div>
            <div class="about-stat-box"><div class="about-stat-num"><span>F500</span></div><div class="about-stat-lbl">Clients</div></div>
            <div class="about-stat-box"><div class="about-stat-num"><span>Global</span></div><div class="about-stat-lbl">Delivery</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="sec-tag">Co-Founder</span>
        <h2 class="sec-h">Kenneth Robles</h2>
        <p class="sec-p">With a background in corporate IT and a passion for operational efficiency, Kenneth transitioned from enterprise environments to build RTC around a single principle: technology should remove friction, not create it.</p>
        <p class="sec-p" style="margin-top:14px;">He leads every client engagement, from initial discovery through delivery and support — ensuring the work we do is always grounded in your actual business goals, not just technical requirements.</p>
        <div class="chips" style="margin-top:22px;">
          <span class="chip">Smartsheet</span>
          <span class="chip">API Integration</span>
          <span class="chip">Web Development</span>
          <span class="chip">Technical Consulting</span>
          <span class="chip">Systems Architecture</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- CHRISTIAN -->
    <div class="leader-bio-grid rv d1">
      <div>
        <span class="sec-tag">Co-Founder</span>
        <h2 class="sec-h">Christian Panes</h2>
        <p class="sec-p">Christian Panes leads RTC's AI practice — designing and deploying agentic AI systems that think, act, and adapt autonomously. He turns bleeding-edge AI research into practical, scalable solutions for real business problems.</p>
        <p class="sec-p" style="margin-top:14px;">From autonomous agents and multi-agent orchestration to LLM fine-tuning and AI workflow automation, Christian Panes brings the technical depth and architectural vision to make RTC's AI capabilities best-in-class.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="about-visual-card">
          <p>Co-Founder and AI Lead at RTC. Christian Panes specializes in agentic AI — building systems that don't just respond, but reason, plan, and execute across complex multi-step workflows. His work defines RTC's AI product direction and technical standards.</p>
          <div class="about-stat-row" style="margin-top:28px;">
            <div class="about-stat-box"><div class="about-stat-num"><span>AI</span></div><div class="about-stat-lbl">Practice Lead</div></div>
            <div class="about-stat-box"><div class="about-stat-num"><span>Agents</span></div><div class="about-stat-lbl">Core Focus</div></div>
            <div class="about-stat-box"><div class="about-stat-num"><span>LLM</span></div><div class="about-stat-lbl">Engineering</div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CORPORATE OFFICERS -->
  <section class="sec" style="background:var(--white);padding-top:0;">
    <div class="rv" style="margin-bottom:48px;">
      <span class="sec-tag">Leadership Team</span>
      <h2 class="sec-h">How RTC is run</h2>
      <p class="sec-p">Five officer positions carry the company: direction, delivery, growth, finance, and governance. Each one is filled — so decisions have a clear owner and nothing waits on a committee.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="team-grid">
      <!-- CEO -->
      <div class="team-member-card rv">
        <div class="tm-avatar">CEO</div>
        <div class="tm-name">Chief Executive Officer</div>
        <div class="tm-role">Direction &amp; Client Outcomes</div>
        <p class="tm-bio">Owns company direction and the standard every engagement is held to. Stays close to client work rather than above it — the person accountable when a commitment is made.</p>
        <div class="tm-tags">
          <span class="tm-tag">Strategy</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Client Delivery</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Partnerships</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- COO -->
      <div class="team-member-card rv d1">
        <div class="tm-avatar">COO</div>
        <div class="tm-name">Chief Operating Officer</div>
        <div class="tm-role">Delivery &amp; Operations</div>
        <p class="tm-bio">Runs how the work actually gets done — capacity, process, and quality across every service line. Turns a signed scope into a delivery plan with dates that hold.</p>
        <div class="tm-tags">
          <span class="tm-tag">Operations</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Resourcing</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Quality</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Director of Marketing and Sales -->
      <div class="team-member-card rv d2">
        <div class="tm-avatar">MS</div>
        <div class="tm-name">Director of Marketing &amp; Sales</div>
        <div class="tm-role">Growth &amp; Pipeline</div>
        <p class="tm-bio">Owns demand: positioning, outbound, and the path from first conversation to signed proposal. Also the internal client for our own GEO practice — we run our playbook on ourselves first.</p>
        <div class="tm-tags">
          <span class="tm-tag">Positioning</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Outbound</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Proposals</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- CFO -->
      <div class="team-member-card rv">
        <div class="tm-avatar">CFO</div>
        <div class="tm-name">Chief Financial Officer</div>
        <div class="tm-role">Finance &amp; Commercial Terms</div>
        <p class="tm-bio">Owns pricing discipline, billing, and the fixed-price commitments we put in writing. Why a quote holds after scoping instead of drifting mid-project.</p>
        <div class="tm-tags">
          <span class="tm-tag">Pricing</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Billing</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Forecasting</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Corporate Secretary -->
      <div class="team-member-card rv d1">
        <div class="tm-avatar">CS</div>
        <div class="tm-name">Corporate Secretary</div>
        <div class="tm-role">Governance &amp; Compliance</div>
        <p class="tm-bio">Keeps the corporation in good standing — records, resolutions, contracts, and regulatory filings. The reason enterprise procurement and vendor onboarding go smoothly.</p>
        <div class="tm-tags">
          <span class="tm-tag">Governance</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Contracts</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Compliance</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- SPECIALIST TEAMS -->
  <section class="sec" style="background:var(--off-white);">
    <div class="rv" style="margin-bottom:48px;">
      <span class="sec-tag">Specialist Teams</span>
      <h2 class="sec-h">The experts behind<br>every engagement</h2>
      <p class="sec-p">Each service line is supported by dedicated specialists — so you always work with someone who knows your domain deeply, not a generalist stretched across too many projects. Every role below is filled today.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="team-grid">
      <!-- GEO Specialist -->
      <div class="team-member-card rv">
        <div class="tm-avatar">GEO</div>
        <div class="tm-name">GEO Specialist</div>
        <div class="tm-role">AI Visibility &amp; Search</div>
        <p class="tm-bio">Runs the GEO practice day to day: visibility baselines across ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity, citation-optimized content, schema, and the monthly scorecard that shows what moved.</p>
        <div class="tm-tags">
          <span class="tm-tag">GEO</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Technical SEO</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Schema</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Reporting</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Automation Engineer -->
      <div class="team-member-card rv d1">
        <div class="tm-avatar">AE</div>
        <div class="tm-name">Automation Engineer</div>
        <div class="tm-role">Workflow &amp; AI Automation</div>
        <p class="tm-bio">Builds the integrations and automations that remove manual steps — APIs between systems, AI-assisted workflows, and the glue that turns spreadsheet-driven operations into something that runs itself.</p>
        <div class="tm-tags">
          <span class="tm-tag">Integrations</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">REST APIs</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">AI Workflows</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Process Design</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Project Manager -->
      <div class="team-member-card rv d2">
        <div class="tm-avatar">PM</div>
        <div class="tm-name">Project Manager</div>
        <div class="tm-role">Scope, Schedule &amp; Comms</div>
        <p class="tm-bio">Keeps engagements on track and clients informed — scope, milestones, and status you don't have to chase. The single point of contact from kickoff through handover.</p>
        <div class="tm-tags">
          <span class="tm-tag">Delivery</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Scoping</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Stakeholder Comms</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Smartsheet Developer -->
      <div class="team-member-card rv">
        <div class="tm-avatar">SS</div>
        <div class="tm-name">Smartsheet Developer</div>
        <div class="tm-role">Smartsheet Build &amp; Architecture</div>
        <p class="tm-bio">Smartsheet specialist covering sheet architecture, automated approval workflows, Control Center, Data Shuttle, and enterprise-grade dashboards that stakeholders actually use.</p>
        <div class="tm-tags">
          <span class="tm-tag">Smartsheet</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Control Center</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Data Shuttle</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Dashboards</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Joining Soon -->
      <div class="team-member-card tm-open rv d1">
        <div class="tm-avatar">+</div>
        <div class="tm-name">Growing the Team</div>
        <div class="tm-role">Multiple Roles Open</div>
        <p class="tm-bio">RTC is actively expanding. We're bringing on specialists across Salesforce, ServiceNow, and mobile development. If you're an exceptional IT professional, we want to hear from you.</p>
        <div class="tm-tags">
          <span class="tm-tag">Salesforce</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">ServiceNow</span>
          <span class="tm-tag">Mobile Dev</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- VALUES STRIP -->
  <div class="stats-bar">
    <div class="stats-pat"></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-n"><span>PH</span></div><div class="stat-l">Philippines-Based</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-n"><span>Global</span></div><div class="stat-l">Delivery Footprint</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-n"><span>AI</span></div><div class="stat-l">Across All Services</div></div>
    <div class="stat"><div class="stat-n"><span>Fair</span></div><div class="stat-l">Compensation for All</div></div>
  </div>

  <!-- HOW WE WORK -->
  <section class="sec" style="background:var(--white);">
    <div class="rv" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:52px;">
      <span class="sec-tag">How We Work</span>
      <h2 class="sec-h">Structured delivery from day one</h2>
      <p class="sec-p" style="margin:0 auto;">Every engagement follows a proven process — so you always know where things stand and what comes next.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="proc-steps">
      <div class="proc-step rv"><div class="step-n">01</div><div class="step-t">Discovery</div><p class="step-d">We listen first. Understanding your workflows, goals, and bottlenecks before proposing anything.</p></div>
      <div class="proc-step rv d1"><div class="step-n">02</div><div class="step-t">Solution Design</div><p class="step-d">We map the right technical approach — scoped, documented, and aligned to your actual business outcomes.</p></div>
      <div class="proc-step rv d2"><div class="step-n">03</div><div class="step-t">Build &amp; Deliver</div><p class="step-d">Execution with consistent communication. You stay informed at every stage — no surprises at launch.</p></div>
      <div class="proc-step rv d3"><div class="step-n">04</div><div class="step-t">Support &amp; Scale</div><p class="step-d">We don't disappear after launch. Ongoing support and iteration ensure solutions scale as you grow.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-final">
    <div class="cta-pat"></div>
    <div class="cta-glow"></div>
    <div class="cta-content">
      <span class="sec-tag" style="color:var(--green);">Work With Our Team</span>
      <h2 class="sec-h" style="color:var(--white);margin-top:8px;">Ready to meet us?</h2>
      <p class="sec-p" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.82);margin:0 auto 32px;">Book a free discovery call and speak directly with our team. We'll scope your project and send a fixed-price proposal within 48 hours.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href="" onclick="Calendly.initPopupWidget({url:'https://calendly.com/kenneth-roblestech/30min'});return false;" class="btn btn-white">Book a Call →</a>
        <a href="/services" class="btn btn-ghost">View Services</a>
      </div>
      <p class="cta-hint" style="margin-top:16px;">Or reach us at <a href="mailto:contact@roblestech.net">contact@roblestech.net</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
